@startuml Create Product (and Units)

title 新增商品 / 新增單位 / 刪除單位（POST /api/v1/products、/units；DELETE /units/{name}，AdminOrWarehouseAdmin）

actor "總管理者 / 倉庫管理者\n(Admin / WarehouseAdmin)" as Caller

box "Ordering.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "CreateProductEndpoint" as Endpoint
end box

box "Ordering.Application" #LightYellow
    participant "ISender" as Sender
    participant "TransactionalDecorator" as Decorator
    participant "CreateProductCommandHandler" as Handler
end box

box "Ordering.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IOrderingUnitOfWork" as UoW
    participant "IProductRepository" as Repo
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB

Caller -> Endpoint : POST /api/v1/products { productNo, name, unit, price }
Endpoint -> Endpoint : RequireAuthorization("AdminOrWarehouseAdmin")
Endpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(CreateProductCommand)
Sender -> Decorator : HandleAsync(request, next, ct)
Decorator -> UoW : BeginAsync(ct)
Decorator -> Handler : next() → HandleAsync(command, ct)

Handler -> Repo : GetByNoAsync(productNo, ct)
alt 商品編號已存在
    Repo --> Handler : Result.Success
    Handler --> Decorator : Error 409 Conflict
else 不存在
    Handler -> Repo : GetUnitByNameAsync(unit, ct)
    alt 單位不存在
        Repo --> Handler : Result.Failure
        Handler --> Decorator : Error
    else 單位存在
        Repo --> Handler : ProductUnit
        Handler -> Handler : Product.Create(productNo, name, unit, price)
        Handler -> Repo : AddAsync(product, ct)
        Repo -> DB : insert into products
        Handler --> Decorator : Result.Success(CreateProductDto)
    end
end

Decorator -> UoW : CommitAsync(ct)
note right of UoW
  Product 沒有 domain event（不像 InboundOrder/
  OutboundOrder），CommitAsync 這裡單純只是
  Transaction.CommitAsync()，沒有東西要 dequeue/publish。
end note
UoW -> DB : commit
Decorator --> Sender : result
Sender --> Endpoint : result
Endpoint --> Caller : 201 Created (Location: /api/v1/products/{id})

note over Handler
  新增單位（CreateProductUnit）、刪除單位
  （DeleteProductUnit，多一個「檢查是否被
  商品引用」的查詢）結構完全一樣：
  Endpoint → Sender → TransactionalDecorator
  → Handler → Repository → DB，這裡不重複畫。
end note

@enduml
